            <img src="/software/astroplot/blog/how-to-pre-sort-raw-files-for-siril/graph-clusters-raw.png" alt="2D scatter plot showing distinct clusters of lights, darks, flats, and biases" class="w-full h-auto block" loading="lazy" />
